Subject: [PATCH] Bind CPU-offloaded optimizer storage with an optional VMA policy

Adapt the mbind mechanism from swiss-ai/Nemo-RL#13 to Megatron's allocation
and optimizer lifecycle, without process-wide mapping scans or diagnostics.

Co-authored-by: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>

